# Schema geo

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Region {
        id String
    }
    class Landmark {
        <<Part>>
        label String
    }
    class GeoEntity {
        <<Abstract>>
        id UUID
        name String
        rank Integer
    }
    class County {
        fips String
    }
    class City {
        population Integer
    }
    GeoEntity --> Region : IN_REGION (one)
    GeoEntity *-- Landmark : LANDMARKS (many)
    GeoEntity <|-- County
    County --> City : SEAT (one)
    GeoEntity <|-- City
```

## Types

### Region

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `String` | primary |  |

### Landmark

*Part type* — instances exist only as composed children.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `label` | `String` | required |  |

### GeoEntity

*Abstract type* — no direct instances.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary |  |
| `name` | `String` | required |  |
| `rank` | `Integer` |  |  |

**Associations**

- `--> IN_REGION (one)` [Region](#region)

**Compositions**

- `*-> LANDMARKS (many)` [Landmark](#landmark)

**Invariants**

- "ranked"

  ```yammm
  ! "ranked" rank >= 0
  ```

### County

Extends: [GeoEntity](#geoentity).

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `fips` | `String` | required |  |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary, from GeoEntity |  |
| `name` | `String` | required, from GeoEntity |  |
| `rank` | `Integer` | from GeoEntity |  |

**Associations**

- `--> SEAT (one)` [City](#city)

- `--> IN_REGION (one)` [Region](#region) — from GeoEntity

**Compositions**

- `*-> LANDMARKS (many)` [Landmark](#landmark) — from GeoEntity

**Invariants**

- "ranked" — from GeoEntity

  ```yammm
  ! "ranked" rank >= 0
  ```

